*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% PPD for the Canon GM2000/GM2080 series, for use with the native
*% rastertocanonijgm filter.  Contains no Canon code; the page geometry
*% matches Canon's own driver so output lands in the same place.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CNGM2080.PPD"

*Manufacturer: "Canon"
*ModelName: "Canon GM2080 series"
*ShortNickName: "Canon GM2080 series"
*NickName: "Canon GM2080 series (native)"
*Product: "(Canon GM2080 series)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 705"
*Throughput: "13"

*% The GM series is a single-black machine, but Canon's driver still sends a
*% continuous-tone sRGB raster and lets the printer do its own halftoning.
*% Declaring a 1-bit black device instead produces a raster the firmware does
*% not expect, so mirror what Canon sends.
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/canon-gm2080/rastertocanonijgm"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-command 0 /Library/Printers/canon-gm2080/cmdtocanonijgm"

*% Maintenance operations. Clean and PrintSelfTestPage are the standard
*% CUPS spellings; the com.canon.* names are vendor extensions.
*cupsCommands: "Clean PrintSelfTestPage com.canon.deepclean com.canon.autoalignment"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*VariablePaperSize: False
*FileSystem: False
*TTRasterizer: Type42

*OpenGroup: General/General

*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Postcard/Hagaki: "<</PageSize[283 420]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize envelop10p/Envelope Com 10: "<</PageSize[297 684]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize envelopdlp/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize businesscard/Business Card: "<</PageSize[156 258]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Postcard/Hagaki: "<</PageSize[283 420]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion envelop10p/Envelope Com 10: "<</PageSize[297 684]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion envelopdlp/Envelope DL: "<</PageSize[312 624]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion businesscard/Business Card: "<</PageSize[156 258]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*% Imageable areas taken from Canon's own PPD for this model.
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "9.64 14.38 585.64 833.50"
*ImageableArea Letter: "18.14 14.18 594.14 783.50"
*ImageableArea legal: "18.14 14.18 594.14 999.50"
*ImageableArea A5: "9.64 13.98 409.84 586.50"
*ImageableArea B5: "9.64 14.78 506.20 720.50"
*ImageableArea Postcard: "9.64 14.66 273.76 411.50"
*ImageableArea envelop10p: "15.87 36.00 281.07 661.32"
*ImageableArea envelopdlp: "15.87 36.48 295.83 601.32"
*ImageableArea businesscard: "9.64 14.30 146.20 249.50"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension B5: "516 729"
*PaperDimension Postcard: "283 420"
*PaperDimension envelop10p: "297 684"
*PaperDimension envelopdlp: "312 624"
*PaperDimension businesscard: "156 258"

*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: plain
*MediaType plain/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(plain)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType highres/High Resolution Paper: "<</MediaType(highres)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType ijpostcard/Ink Jet Hagaki: "<</MediaType(ijpostcard)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType postcard/Hagaki: "<</MediaType(postcard)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType envelope/Envelope: "<</MediaType(envelope)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 25 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 19/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 dpi: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Duplex/Two-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long Edge: "<</Duplex true/Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short Edge: "<</Duplex true/Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*CloseGroup: General

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
